  "additional_integration_checks": [
    "Actual usage() invokes codex-usage then targeted public status and retains both raw readings; no writes to private state.",
    "A reset occurring between live read and status fails if new cached read_at is later than live checked_at; next ordinary read may retry validation, not model phase.",
    "All old tests retain accepted semantics except unknown-state below80 cases are now explicitly rejected. Existing above80 active matching route and cached-age telemetry behavior unchanged.",
